St. Clavis Gakuin 
High School

00:21:24.810 --> 00:21:27.100
Th-They've received an amazing score!

00:21:27.100 --> 00:21:31.520
A technical score of 83.67
and a performance score of 57.17

00:21:31.520 --> 00:21:33.520
for a total of 140.84!

00:21:33.520 --> 00:21:35.270
St. Clavis Gakuin!

00:21:35.270 --> 00:21:37.730
This is the highest score
in the history of the series!

